        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Here\u2019s a heartfelt message that\u2019s warm, proud, and not too long, but still says everything that matters. You can copy it exactly or tweak a line to make it even more *you*:\n\n---\n\n**My sweet Donivan,**\n\nEighteen years ago, you made me a mom and changed my life forever. We grew up together, side by side, and you have been my greatest joy, my best buddy, and my constant. I am endlessly proud of the man you are becoming and so grateful I get to call you my son. You will always be my prince, no matter how tall you stand or how far you go. I love you more than words could ever say.\n\n**Happy 18th Birthday.  \nLove, Mom \ud83e\udd0d**\n\n---\n\nIf you want a *slightly* edgier or more playful version, or one with faith woven in, I can do that too."
          ]
