        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Here\u2019s a long, proud, emotional, **zappy** Instagram caption that carries the weight of the journey and the joy of the moment. It\u2019s written to flow perfectly with a baby-to-18 slideshow and hit people right in the heart.\n\n---\n\n18 years.  \nEighteen *whole* years of you, **Donivan**.\n\nFrom the very first moment I held you, I knew my life had been permanently rewritten. I did not just become a mom. I became stronger. Braver. More determined. More alive. You and I grew up together. Side by side. Hand in hand. Sometimes learning as we went. Sometimes figuring it out the hard way. Always loving each other fiercely.\n\nWe were a team long before the world saw it.  \nBest buddies. Ride or dies. Late night talks. Inside jokes. Shared music. Shared grit. Shared hearts.\n\nBeing a single mom was not always easy, but being *your* mom made it worth every single sacrifice. You gave me purpose on the days I was tired. Strength on the days I felt unsure. Hope on the days the world felt heavy. You watched me fight. You watched me rebuild. And without even realizing it, you taught me how to be better.\n\nWatching you grow from that tiny baby into the man you are becoming feels surreal. You are kind. You are thoughtful. You are strong in ways that matter. You have a heart that feels deeply and a mind that sees the world differently. You make people laugh. You stand up for what is right. You love big. And you carry yourself with a quiet confidence that tells me everything I need to know about who you are becoming.\n\nI am so incredibly proud of you. Not just for what you\u2019ve accomplished, but for who you *are* when no one is watching.\n\nYou will always be my prince.  \nAlways my boy.  \nAlways my greatest blessing.\n\nEighteen does not mean I stop cheering. It means I get to watch you step into your life with everything you have inside you. Wherever you go, whatever you do, you carry my whole heart with you.\n\nHappy 18th birthday, Donivan.  \nI love you beyond words. Beyond time. Beyond measure. \ud83e\udd0d\ud83d\udc51\n\n---\n\nIf you want, I can also:\n\u2022 Make a shorter punchier version  \n\u2022 Add faith or gratitude to God  \n\u2022 Make it slightly funnier or sassier  \n\u2022 Create a second caption just for the final slide  \n\nJust tell me the vibe \ud83d\udc9b"
          ]
        },
